  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないに　ちくでんきのうを　もつ。\nキャンプの　ときなど　１ぴき　いると\nとても　ありがたい　ポケモンだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체내에 축전 기능을 갖추고 있다.\n캠핑할 때 1마리 있으면\n아주 고마운 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有在體內蓄電的能力。\n露營的時候有１隻這種寶可夢在的話，\n是非常值得慶幸的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec son corps capable de stocker l’électricité\ncomme une batterie, il a déjà sauvé la mise à\nplus d’un campeur peu prévoyant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Speichert Elektrizität in seinem Körper.\nBei einem Campingausflug kann man wohl kein\npraktischeres Pokémon dabeihaben!",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Almacena electricidad en su cuerpo, lo que\npuede resultar útil en numerosas situaciones,\ncomo al salir de acampada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può immagazzinare elettricità all’interno del\ncorpo. Per questo la sua compagnia è utile\nquando si va in campeggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its body is capable of storing electricity. On\ncamping trips, people are grateful to have\none around.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内に　蓄電機能を　持つ。\nキャンプの　ときなど　１匹　いると\nとても　ありがたい　ポケモンだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有在体内蓄电的能力。\n露营等时候有１只这种宝可梦的话，\n会非常值得庆幸。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Almacena electricidad en su cuerpo, lo que\npuede resultar útil en numerosas situaciones,\ncomo al salir de acampada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くらった　エサを　しょうか　するとき\nはっせいした　でんきエネルギーを\nでんきぶくろに　ためこんでいる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹은 먹이를 소화할 때\n발생하는 전기 에너지를\n전기 주머니에 저장하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "吃下食物後進行消化時\n產生的電能會被儲藏在電力袋中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son processus de digestion produit de\nl’électricité, qui est immédiatement stockée\ndans une poche prévue à cet effet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Beim Verdauen der Nahrung entsteht\nelektrische Energie, die es in seinem\nStrombeutel speichert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al hacer la digestión genera energía eléctrica\nque almacena en la bolsa que posee para tal\nefecto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Genera energia elettrica durante la digestione\ne la conserva in una sacca interna.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "From the food it digests, it generates electricity,\nand it stores this energy in its electric sac.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喰らった　餌を　消化　するとき\n発生した　電気エネルギーを\n電気袋に　溜め込んでいる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会将消化吃下的食物时\n所产生的电能储藏在电力袋中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al hacer la digestión genera energía eléctrica\nque almacena en la bolsa que posee para tal\nefecto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おちばに　うまり　ほとんど　うごかず\nひたすら　ふようどを　くっている。\nまちがって　ふむと　ビリビリするぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "낙엽에 묻혀 거의 움직이지 않고\n그저 부엽토만 먹는다.\n잘못 밟으면 찌릿찌릿하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "埋在落葉堆裡幾乎不動，\n只是不斷地吃著腐葉土。\n如果不小心踩到牠就會被電到。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il passe son temps à manger du terreau, tapi\nsans bouger sous les feuilles mortes. Gare\nà la décharge si vous lui marchez dessus !",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es vergräbt sich unter Blättern, wo es nahezu\nregungslos verharrt und Humus frisst. Tritt man\nversehentlich auf es, verteilt es Stromschläge.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escondido bajo la hojarasca, permanece casi\ninmóvil mientras come humus con fruición. Quien\nlo pisa en un descuido se lleva una descarga.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nasconde tra le foglie cadute a terra e rimane\nimmobile nutrendosi esclusivamente di humus.\nChi lo pesta per sbaglio prende la scossa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It buries itself in fallen leaves and barely\nmoves, munching away on humus. If you\naccidentally step on one, you’ll get a shock!",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "落ち葉に　埋まり　ほとんど　動かず\nひたすら　腐葉土を　食っている。\n間違って　踏むと　ビリビリするぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "埋在落叶里一动不动，\n专心致志地吃着腐叶土。\n如果不小心错踩到它，就会被电到。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escondido bajo la hojarasca, permanece casi\ninmóvil mientras come humus con fruición. Quien\nlo pisa en un descuido se lleva una descarga.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おそわれても　がんじょうな　カラで\nまもりに　てっする。　しつこい\nあいてには　でんきで　はんげき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "공격을 받아도 튼튼한 껍질로\n철저히 방어한다. 끈질긴\n상대에게는 전기로 반격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "即使遭到襲擊也會用\n堅固的外殼貫徹守勢。\n遇到糾纏不休的對手時會用電來反擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa solide carapace lui sert de protection en\ncas d’attaque. Si un ennemi s’acharne, il riposte\navec une décharge électrique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird es angegriffen, gewährt ihm sein robuster\nPanzer hervorragenden Schutz. Hartnäckige\nGegner greift es mit Elektro-Attacken an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando lo atacan, se protege con su robusto\ncaparazón. Si el rival lo sigue atosigando, le\nsuelta una descarga eléctrica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo robusto esoscheletro lo protegge dagli\nattacchi. Se il nemico non molla, contrattacca\ncon scariche elettriche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its stout shell provides excellent defense from\nattacks. It uses electricity on\npersistent opponents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "襲われても　頑丈な　カラで\n守りに　徹する。　しつこい\n相手には　電気で　反撃。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "即使被袭击也会一直用\n结实的外壳保护自己。\n会用电反击纠缠不休的对手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando lo atacan, se protege con su robusto\ncaparazón. Si el rival lo sigue atosigando, le\nsuelta una descarga eléctrica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "がんじょうな　カラで　みを　まもる。\nアゴの　せんたんから　でんきを\nながして　はんげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "튼튼한 껍질로 몸을 보호한다.\n턱의 끝부분에서 전기를\n흘려보내 반격한다.",
      "language": {
